# Scrape.do

> Scrape.do is a powerful web scraping API that provides unblocked access to public web data at scale. With a 99.98% success rate, it automatically bypasses anti-bot protections including Cloudflare, DataDome, PerimeterX, and more. Built with 150M+ rotating proxies across 150+ countries, automatic CAPTCHA handling, headless browser rendering, and pay-per-successful-request pricing. No infrastructure management required.

