## Features

> Scrape.do features

- [Anti-Bot Bypass That Actually Works](https://scrape.do/features/anti-bot-bypass.md): Bypass Cloudflare, DataDome, PerimeterX and other anti-bot systems with 99.98% success rate. Fully automated, no setup required.
- [Asynchronous Web Scraper Built for Scale](https://scrape.do/features/asynchronous-web-scraper.md): Submit thousands of URLs and retrieve results without managing queues or infrastructure. Asynchronous scraping designed for high-volume data collection.
- [CAPTCHA Bypass Built Into Every Request](https://scrape.do/features/captcha-handling.md): Bypass reCAPTCHA v2/v3, hCaptcha, and image challenges automatically. No configuration needed, no third-party services — built directly into every request.
- [Dynamic TLS Fingerprinting for Bot Detection](https://scrape.do/features/dynamic-tls-fingerprinting.md): Real browser-aligned TLS fingerprints that rotate per request. Avoid detection patterns with authentic JA3 and cipher suite combinations.
- [Geo-Targeting for Web Scraping](https://scrape.do/features/geo-targeting.md): Access localized content from 160+ countries with real IPs. Target any region with residential or datacenter proxies automatically.
- [Headless Browser API for Web Scraping](https://scrape.do/features/headless-browser.md): Render JavaScript-heavy pages, interact with elements, capture screenshots, and extract iframes or WebSocket data. Full browser automation in a single API call.
- [Automatic Proxy Rotation for Web Scraping](https://scrape.do/features/proxy-rotator.md): Fresh residential, mobile and datacenter proxies on every request. Enterprise-grade rotation with zero configuration.
- [Header and User Agent Rotation](https://scrape.do/features/user-agent-rotator.md): Automatically rotate headers and user-agents on every request. Device-aware profiles that match real browser traffic patterns.

